        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;div style=&quot;background-color:#ffffff;color:#080808&quot;&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;font-family:&#39;JetBrains Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:9.8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;# [&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;font-family:&#39;Menlo-Regular&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;概率&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;] &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;font-family:&#39;Menlo-Regular&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;沿&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt; MC &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;font-family:&#39;Menlo-Regular&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;维求样本方差。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;torch.var &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;font-family:&#39;Menlo-Regular&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;默认采用&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt; Bessel &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;font-family:&#39;Menlo-Regular&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;修正，分母是&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt; J-1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;font-family:&#39;Menlo-Regular&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;。&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;# [&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;font-family:&#39;Menlo-Regular&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;易错&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;] &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;font-family:&#39;Menlo-Regular&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;这里逐状态分量计算方差，只得到完整协方差矩阵的对角线，不含状态间非对角协方差。&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;# &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;font-family:&#39;Menlo-Regular&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;预测越分散，方差越大；预测越一致，方差越小。&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;cov_hat_bnn&lt;/span&gt;[&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;] = torch.var(&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x_hat_temp&lt;/span&gt;[&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;].clone(), &lt;span style=&quot;color:#660099;&quot;&gt;dim&lt;/span&gt;=-&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1750eb;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" link="&lt;div style=&quot;background-color:#ffffff;color:#080808&quot;&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;font-family:&#39;JetBrains Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:9.8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;# [&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;font-family:&#39;Menlo-Regular&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;概率&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;] &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;font-family:&#39;Menlo-Regular&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;沿&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt; MC &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;font-family:&#39;Menlo-Regular&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;维求样本方差。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;torch.var &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;font-family:&#39;Menlo-Regular&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;默认采用&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt; Bessel &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;font-family:&#39;Menlo-Regular&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;修正，分母是&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt; J-1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;font-family:&#39;Menlo-Regular&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;。&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;# [&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;font-family:&#39;Menlo-Regular&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;易错&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;] &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;font-family:&#39;Menlo-Regular&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;这里逐状态分量计算方差，只得到完整协方差矩阵的对角线，不含状态间非对角协方差。&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;# &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;font-family:&#39;Menlo-Regular&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;预测越分散，方差越大；预测越一致，方差越小。&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;cov_hat_bnn&lt;/span&gt;[&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;] = torch.var(&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;x_hat_temp&lt;/span&gt;[&lt;span style=&quot;color:#000000;&quot;&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;].clone(), &lt;span style=&quot;color:#660099;&quot;&gt;dim&lt;/span&gt;=-&lt;span style=&quot;color:#1750eb;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" id="mugb4C7OIwAR_cT8KM-D-149">
