        <mxCell id="cxnF5ro4i54K7u0uLYNZ-38" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(8, 8, 8);&quot;&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;font-family:&#39;JetBrains Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:9.8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(8, 8, 8);&quot;&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;font-family:&#39;JetBrains Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:9.8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;# [&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;font-family:&#39;Menlo-Regular&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;核心&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt;] GRU &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;font-family:&#39;Menlo-Regular&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;保存时间信息；&lt;br&gt;其输出会再次经过一个独立的&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;Concrete Dropout &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#8c8c8c;font-style:italic;font-family:&#39;Menlo-Regular&#39;,monospace;&quot;&gt;模块。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;GRU_out&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(148, 85, 141);&quot;&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;.hn&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
